## Output Format

Return a JSON object:

```json
{
  "root_cause": "<one-sentence diagnosis of WHY the current strategy failed>",
  "obstacle_type": "timeout | rate_limit | model_unavailable | method_limitation | data_issue | unknown",
  "next_strategy": "<the next strategy from the pivot ladder>",
  "strategy_params": {
    "<parameter_name>": "<value>"
  },
  "next_action": "retry | skip | escalate",
  "predicted_completion": "<estimated completion % after applying this pivot>",
  "metacognition_notes": "<kata reflection: what was learned about the failure mode that the next iteration should use>",
  "kata_step": "understand_direction | grasp_current_condition | establish_target | experiment"
}
```

The `strategy_params` object should contain the specific parameters the
Do step needs for the next iteration (e.g., {"force_ocr": true} for convert,
{"max_tokens": 256} for chunk, {"concurrency": 2} for tag).

If next_strategy is "skip_and_escalate", set next_action to "escalate"
and explain in metacognition_notes what was learned and what a human
operator should do next.